  "reason": "No experiments have been completed, so there is no evidence yet about which modality, encoder, profile setting, or fusion strategy is most useful. The main uncertainty is whether a simple RNA-only model provides a competitive baseline and what performance level should be expected before adding complexity. config_001 tests a minimal RNA-only, single-profile, PCA-based configuration without image, aggregation, or fusion confounds. It is the best next experiment because it establishes a clean reference point for later comparisons of RNA encoders, multiprofile aggregation, and multimodal fusion while avoiding premature investment in more complex designs."
